OL,3,GNEWSATrump says Northern Ireland
OL,4,Ajoining Ireland only natural
OL,5,
OL,6,FPresident Donald Trump has doubled down
OL,7,Fon his support for a united Ireland.
OL,9,FHe's on day two of a visit, which he is
OL,10,Fspending at Trump International Golf
OL,11,FLinks in Doonbeg, County Clare, for the
OL,12,FIrish Open.
OL,14,FOn Saturday, Trump told reporters he
OL,15,Fwould love to see a united Ireland
OL,16,Fwhile at a meeting with the Taoiseach
OL,17,F(Irish PM) Micheal Martin in Dublin.
OL,19,FSpeaking on Sunday at his Doonbeg golf
OL,20,Fresort, he said it would be natural to
OL,21,Fput Ireland and Northern Ireland
OL,22,F"together".
